target
**/target
*.db
*.log

# The project-local envmux state: database (and its WAL), logs, mirrors,
# shadow history. It changes on every daemon heartbeat, so shipping it in the
# context busts the build cache each run — and on Windows the live WAL can be
# locked, which fails the context upload outright.
.envmux

# Node and docs build artifacts: large, regenerated, and irrelevant to the
# image. Shipping them in the build context slows every build and, on Windows
# named pipes, is enough to break the context upload outright.
**/node_modules
docs/dist
